Experience managing pilots or proof-of-concept programs, including running RFP or vendor selection processes.
Experience conducting structured stakeholder interviews or focus groups and translating findings into actionable recommendations.
Preferred qualifications
HVAC/MEP familiarity.
Experience at an organization that sells or manages physical product installations.
Public health or biosecurity experience.
